        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Morphic Hands"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, transmutation)\n\nA shield archon's hands can change into a +1 holy striking spear and a lesser sturdy shield or back into hands. Transforming does not restore any HP to the items, and if either the weapon or shield is fully destroyed, the archon loses that hand until it receives a regenerate spell or similar magic. If a shield archon is slain, its weapon and shield can be taken, but they fade into nothingness after 24 hours."
            },
